    "commit_body": "score=0 + pct_from_ema50 < -10% represents active capitulation, not a fresh\nput setup. Apply gradient lift: ext=10%\u21925, 15%\u219210, 20%+\u219220. Filters deeply\nextended stocks out of <5/<10/<15 buckets where WR was dropping off.\n\nValidated 5y diff-assess vs v19 DB:\n  <5  WR15 65.8%\u219271.2% (N 652\u2192657)\n  <10 WR15 68.1%\u219272.6% (N 1787\u21921813)\n  <15 WR15 67.8%\u219271.0% (N 4449\u21924481)\nMid/upper put buckets and call side unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
